<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>한자 마스터 Pro</title>
<script>
(function(){function sh(m){var d=document.getElementById('err-bn');if(!d){d=document.createElement('div');d.id='err-bn';d.style.cssText='position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:99999;background:#be123c;color:#fff;font:12px/1.5 sans-serif;padding:10px 14px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all';(document.body||document.documentElement).appendChild(d)}d.textContent='⚠ 오류: '+m+'\n(이 문구를 캡처해서 알려주세요)'}
window.addEventListener('error',function(e){sh((e.message||'')+(e.filename?' @'+e.filename.split('/').pop()+':'+e.lineno:''))});
window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',function(e){sh('Promise: '+((e.reason&&e.reason.message)||e.reason))});})();
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script>if(window.tailwind)tailwind.config={darkMode:'class'}</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hanzi-writer@3.5/dist/hanzi-writer.min.js"></script>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;700;900&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
html{overflow-y:scroll;scroll-behavior:auto!important}
body{font-family:'Noto Sans KR',system-ui,sans-serif}
.hj{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif}
.tab{padding:.5rem 1rem;border-radius:.75rem;transition:all .2s}
.tab.on,.sel-on{background:#4f46e5!important;color:#fff!important;border-color:#4f46e5!important}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:1.25rem;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s,background-color .2s}
.dark .card{background:#1e293b;border-color:#334155}
.inp{width:100%;padding:.5rem .75rem;border-radius:.75rem;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem}
.dark .inp{background:#0f172a;border-color:#334155}
.mdl{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(15,23,42,.75);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:1rem;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.mdl.open{display:flex}
.card-selected{border-color:#6366f1!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #6366f1}
.fdrag{user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;-webkit-touch-callout:none}
.b{padding:.5rem .75rem;border-radius:.75rem;font-weight:700;font-size:.75rem;transition:background-color .2s}
.g{background:#e2e8f0}.dark .g{background:#1e293b}
.pri{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff}.grn{background:#059669;color:#fff}.red{background:#e11d48;color:#fff}
</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen pb-20">

<header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
    <button onclick="go(null)" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-lg shrink-0"><span class="hj w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white grid place-items-center">漢</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">한자 마스터 Pro</span></button>
    <span id="crumb" class="hidden text-sm font-black text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 truncate"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="flex gap-2 shrink-0">
    <button onclick="openTrash()" class="b g">🗑️<span id="trash-n" class="ml-1"></span></button>
    <button onclick="startReset()" class="b g" title="모든 데이터 초기화">♻️<span class="hidden sm:inline ml-1">초기화</span></button>
    <button onclick="toggleTheme()" class="b g">🌓</button>
  </div>
</div>
</header>

<main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-5">
<section id="v-home" class="space-y-5">
  <h2 class="text-center text-xl font-black pt-2">무엇을 공부할까요?</h2>
  <div id="home-cards" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto"></div>
  <div id="home-quick" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center text-xs font-bold"></div>
</section>

<div id="sec-bar" class="hidden mb-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
  <nav class="flex gap-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-1 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <button id="st-study" class="tab" onclick="go(nav.sec,'study')"></button>
    <button id="st-quiz" class="tab" onclick="go(nav.sec,'quiz')">✍ 퀴즈</button>
  </nav>
  <div id="sec-add-wrap"><button id="sec-add" onclick="secAdd()" class="b grn py-2.5"></button></div>
</div></div>

<section id="v-hanja" class="hidden space-y-4">
  <div id="folder-view" class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <h2 class="text-base font-black">📂 학습 폴더</h2>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <button id="btn-edit" onclick="toggleFolderEdit()" class="b g">✏ 폴더 수정</button>
        <button onclick="addFolder()" class="b pri">+ 새 폴더</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="folder-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="item-view" class="space-y-4 hidden">
    <div class="card p-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
        <button onclick="openFolderView()" class="b g shrink-0">◀ 폴더</button>
        <h2 id="active-folder-title" class="font-black text-sm text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 truncate"></h2>
      </div>
      <span id="cnt" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 shrink-0"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center">
      <input id="f-q" oninput="renderItems()" class="inp flex-1 min-w-[150px]" placeholder="한자, 음, 뜻 검색...">
      <select id="f-status" onchange="renderItems()" class="inp w-auto"><option value="">전체 상태</option><option value="u">미암기</option><option value="l">암기 완료</option><option value="b">북마크</option></select>
      <button id="btn-select-mode" onclick="toggleSelectMode()" class="b bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800">☑ 다중 선택</button>
    </div>
    <div id="batch-bar" class="hidden card p-3 bg-indigo-50 flex-wrap gap-2 items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold">
      <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer select-none"><input type="checkbox" id="chk-all" onchange="selectAll(this.checked)" class="w-4 h-4 accent-indigo-600"><span id="batch-count" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-black">0개 선택됨</span></label>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">이동:</span>
        <select id="batch-target-folder" class="inp !w-auto !py-1"></select>
        <button onclick="batchMoveFolder()" class="b pri">폴더 이동</button>
        <button onclick="batchToggleLearned(true)" class="b grn">암기 완료</button>
        <button onclick="batchToggleLearned(false)" class="b bg-slate-600 text-white">미암기</button>
        <button onclick="batchDelete()" class="b red">삭제</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="grid" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3"></div>
    <p id="empty" class="hidden text-center text-sm text-slate-400 py-16">이 폴더에 한자가 없습니다. 위의 "+ 한자 추가"로 추가해 보세요.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="v-words" class="hidden space-y-4">
  <div class="card p-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center text-xs">
    <h2 class="font-black text-sm mr-auto">📝 단어장 <span id="w-cnt" class="text-xs text-slate-400"></span></h2>
    <input id="w-q" oninput="renderWords()" class="inp !w-40" placeholder="단어 검색...">
    <select id="w-st" onchange="renderWords()" class="inp !w-auto"><option value="">전체</option><option value="u">미암기</option><option value="l">암기 완료</option><option value="b">북마크</option></select>
    <label class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer select-none"><input type="checkbox" id="w-hide" onchange="wReveal.clear();renderWords()" class="w-4 h-4 accent-indigo-600">뜻 가리기</label>
  </div>
  <div id="w-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3"></div>
  <p id="w-empty" class="hidden text-center text-sm text-slate-400 py-16">등록된 단어가 없습니다. 위의 "+ 단어 추가"로 추가해 보세요.</p>
</section>

<section id="v-quiz" class="hidden">
  <div id="qz-cfg" class="card p-6 max-w-sm mx-auto space-y-4 text-xs shadow-md">
    <h2 id="qz-title" class="text-base font-black text-center"></h2>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div id="qz-w-folder"><label class="block font-bold mb-1">폴더</label><select id="q-folder" class="inp"></select></div>
      <div id="qz-w-mode"><label class="block font-bold mb-1">문제 유형</label><select id="q-mode" class="inp"><option value="w2m">한자 단어 → 뜻</option><option value="m2w">뜻 → 한자 단어</option><option value="w2r">한자 단어 → 독음</option></select></div>
      <div><label class="block font-bold mb-1">범위</label><select id="q-scope" class="inp"><option value="">전체</option><option value="u">미암기만</option><option value="b">북마크만</option></select></div>
      <div><label class="block font-bold mb-1">문제 수</label><select id="q-n" class="inp"><option value="10" selected>10개</option><option value="20">20개</option><option value="30">30개</option><option value="50">50개</option><option value="all">전체</option></select></div>
    </div>
    <p id="qz-warn" class="hidden text-center text-rose-500 font-bold"></p>
    <button id="qz-start" onclick="startQuiz()" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl pri font-bold text-sm">퀴즈 시작</button>
  </div>
  <div id="qz-play" class="card p-6 max-w-md mx-auto space-y-3 hidden shadow-md">
    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-400"><span id="qz-prog"></span><span id="qz-score" class="text-indigo-500 font-bold"></span></div>
    <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div id="qz-bar" class="bg-indigo-600 h-full transition-all" style="width:0"></div></div>
    <div id="qz-hint" class="text-center text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 pt-2"></div>
    <div id="qz-big"></div>
    <div id="qz-ch" class="grid gap-2"></div>
    <p class="hidden sm:block text-center text-[10px] text-slate-400">키보드 1~4로도 고를 수 있어요</p>
  </div>
  <div id="qz-res" class="card p-8 max-w-md mx-auto text-center space-y-4 hidden shadow-md">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-black">퀴즈 완료!</h2>
    <p id="qz-final" class="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-500"></p>
    <div id="qz-wrong" class="text-left space-y-1.5 text-xs"></div>
    <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm font-bold">
      <button id="qz-retry" onclick="retryWrong()" class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-white">틀린 것만 다시</button>
      <button onclick="prepQuiz()" class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl pri">처음부터</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<div id="m-search" class="mdl"><div class="card w-full max-w-xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
  <div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-2">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><h3 class="font-bold">한자 검색 <span id="src" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-500"></span></h3><button onclick="closeM('m-search')" class="text-slate-400 text-xl">✕</button></div>
    <div class="flex gap-2"><input id="s-q" class="inp" placeholder="한자·음·뜻 (예: 水, 수, 물)" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')doSearch()"><button onclick="doSearch()" class="b grn px-4 shrink-0">검색</button></div>
    <label class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">저장할 폴더 <select id="s-folder" class="inp w-auto !py-1"></select></label>
  </div>
  <div id="s-res" class="p-4 overflow-y-auto space-y-2 min-h-[220px]"><p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-400 py-10">검색어를 입력하세요.</p></div>
</div></div>

<div id="m-detail" class="mdl"><div class="card w-full max-w-3xl max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4"><span id="d-sub" class="text-sm text-slate-400"></span><button onclick="closeDetail()" class="text-slate-400 text-2xl">✕</button></div>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
    <div class="text-center space-y-5"><div id="d-char" class="hj text-8xl sm:text-9xl font-black text-indigo-500 leading-none"></div><div id="d-mean" class="space-y-2"></div><div id="d-words" class="text-sm text-slate-400"></div></div>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center">
      <div class="relative mx-auto w-[260px] h-[260px] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"><div id="hw" class="w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center relative"></div></div>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-2"><button onclick="HW&&HW.anim()" class="b bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800 py-2.5">▶ 획순 재생</button><button onclick="HW&&HW.quiz()" class="b pri py-2.5">✍ 직접 쓰기</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <span class="text-slate-400">소속 폴더</span><select id="d-folder" onchange="moveItem(this.value)" class="inp w-auto !py-1.5"></select>
    <button onclick="delItem()" class="text-rose-500 font-bold">삭제</button>
  </div>
</div></div>

<div id="m-wd" class="mdl"><div class="card w-full max-w-3xl max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xl mb-4">
    <span class="flex gap-4 text-slate-400"><button id="wd-mark" onclick="wdTog('mark')">★</button><button id="wd-learn" onclick="wdTog('learned')">✔</button></span>
    <button onclick="closeWd()" class="text-slate-400 text-2xl">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
    <div class="text-center space-y-4">
      <div id="wd-word" class="hj text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-black text-indigo-500 break-all leading-tight"></div>
      <div id="wd-read" class="text-lg font-bold"></div><div id="wd-mean"></div><div id="wd-ex" class="text-left space-y-2"></div>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">한자별로 보기 · 눌러서 선택</div>
      <div id="wd-chars" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center">
      <div id="wd-cinfo" class="space-y-2"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto w-[260px] h-[260px] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"><div id="ww" class="w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center relative"></div></div>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-2"><button onclick="WW&&WW.anim()" class="b bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800 py-2.5">▶ 획순 재생</button><button onclick="WW&&WW.quiz()" class="b pri py-2.5">✍ 직접 쓰기</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <button onclick="wdEdit()" class="font-bold text-slate-500">✏️ 수정</button><button onclick="wdDel()" class="text-rose-500 font-bold">삭제</button>
  </div>
</div></div>

<div id="m-fmenu" class="mdl"><div class="card w-full max-w-xs p-5 space-y-2 text-sm shadow-2xl">
  <h3 id="fm-title" class="font-bold text-center truncate pb-1"></h3>
  <button onclick="fmDo('rename')" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl pri font-bold">✏️ 이름 변경</button>
  <button onclick="fmDo('delete')" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl red font-bold">🗑️ 삭제</button>
  <button onclick="closeM('m-fmenu')" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl g font-bold">닫기</button>
</div></div>

<div id="m-trash" class="mdl"><div class="card w-full max-w-xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
  <div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center"><div><h3 class="font-bold">🗑️ 휴지통</h3><p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">삭제한 항목은 30일 동안 보관돼요.</p></div><button onclick="closeM('m-trash')" class="text-slate-400 text-xl">✕</button></div>
  <div id="trash-list" class="p-4 overflow-y-auto space-y-2 min-h-[200px]"></div>
  <div class="p-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-right"><button onclick="emptyTrash()" class="b red py-2">휴지통 비우기</button></div>
</div></div>

<div id="m-word" class="mdl"><div class="card w-full max-w-lg p-7 space-y-5 text-sm shadow-2xl">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><h3 id="w-title" class="font-black text-lg">단어 추가</h3><button onclick="closeM('m-word')" class="text-slate-400 text-2xl">✕</button></div>
  <div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><label class="font-bold">단어 (한자)</label><button type="button" onclick="toggleFind()" class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-500">🔍 한자 찾아서 넣기</button></div>
    <input id="w-word" class="inp hj !py-3.5 !text-2xl" placeholder="예: 學校" onblur="autoFillWord()">
    <div id="w-find-box" class="hidden mt-3 p-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex gap-2"><input id="w-find" class="inp" placeholder="음 또는 뜻 (예: 학, 배울)" oninput="findHanja()"><button type="button" onclick="wordBack()" class="b g shrink-0" title="마지막 한자 지우기">⌫</button></div>
      <div id="w-chips" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 max-h-44 overflow-y-auto"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div><label class="block font-bold mb-2">독음 <span class="font-normal text-slate-400 text-xs">(비우면 자동, 두음법칙은 직접 수정)</span></label><input id="w-read" class="inp !py-3.5 !text-base" placeholder="예: 학교"></div>
  <div><label class="block font-bold mb-2">뜻</label><input id="w-mean" class="inp !py-3.5 !text-base" placeholder="예: 학생을 가르치는 곳" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')saveWord()"></div>
  <div><label class="block font-bold mb-2">예문 <span class="font-normal text-slate-400 text-xs">(선택 · 줄바꿈으로 여러 개)</span></label><textarea id="w-ex" rows="3" class="inp !py-3 !text-base" placeholder="예: 그는 學校에 다닌다."></textarea></div>
  <button onclick="saveWord()" class="w-full py-4 rounded-xl pri font-bold text-base">저장</button>
</div></div>

<div id="m-reset" class="mdl" style="z-index:70"><div class="card w-full max-w-md p-6 space-y-4 text-sm shadow-2xl border-rose-500">
  <div class="text-center text-4xl">⚠️</div>
  <h3 class="font-black text-lg text-center text-rose-500">마지막 확인</h3>
  <p class="text-center text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">아래 데이터가 <b class="text-rose-500">영구 삭제</b>되고 되돌릴 수 없어요.<br>휴지통에 있는 항목도 함께 사라져요.</p>
  <div id="reset-info" class="rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/40 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900 p-3 text-xs space-y-1"></div>
  <p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-400">초기화하면 처음 설치한 상태(기본 한자 8개)로 돌아가요.</p>
